    "synopsis": {
        "native": "En thalasso \u00e0 Biarritz avec sa meilleure amie, Violette, quadra parisienne travaillant dans la mode, rencontre Jean-Ren\u00e9, un modeste informaticien fra\u00eechement divorc\u00e9. Apr\u00e8s des ann\u00e9es de solitude, elle se laisse s\u00e9duire. Il la rejoint \u00e0 Paris, tentant de s'adapter au microcosme parisien dans lequel elle \u00e9volue. Mais c\u2019est sans compter sur la pr\u00e9sence de Lolo, le fils ch\u00e9ri de Violette, pr\u00eat \u00e0 tout pour d\u00e9truire le couple naissant et conserver sa place de favori.",
        "english": "While doing thalassotherapy in Biarritz with her best friend, Violette, a forty-something Parisian working in fashion, encounters Jean-Ren\u00e9, a simple computer analyst newly-divorced. After years of solitude, she lets him seduce her. Jean-Ren\u00e9 joins Violette in Paris, trying to adapt to the Parisian microcosm in which she lives. But he hadn't taken into account Lolo, Violette's darling daughter, ready to do anything to destroy the budding relationship and to preserve her privileged position."
